	"data": "MIT — EECS & Media Lab (XR / Spatial Computing)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nMIT is the world's premier institution for technology research, and its approach to XR and spatial computing spans multiple programs. Two primary pathways are relevant:\nPhD in EECS (Electrical Engineering and Computer Science) — the traditional research doctorate, with faculty working on computer vision, HCI, and graphics as applied to XR\nMAS (Media Arts and…",
